{
  "$comment": "Conformance vectors for the Fleetwrit fingerprint. Generated from fleetwrit.fingerprint; regenerate with scripts, do not hand-edit. Canonical JSON is JCS-style (sorted keys, compact separators, UTF-8) over the fields listed in 'fingerprint_fields'; a v0 approximation of RFC 8785 for numbers.",
